{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33921","headline":"洛中寒食二首 二 · 皮日休","name":"洛中寒食二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远近垂杨映钿车，天津桥影压神霞。\n弄春公子正回首，趁节行人不到家。\n洛水万年云母竹，汉陵千载野棠花。\n欲知豪贵堪愁处，请看邙山晚照斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}